From bbc0ff2e07dce5d560b561ba78166c0c64daafba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozgur Guzeldereli <ozgur@guzeldereli.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:37:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] TTF side tensors: per-input-channel scale, centring, bias
 and a low-rank ternary adapter on any weight

Optional tensors next to a weight (<base>.ttf_c / ttf_m / ttf_b, <base>.ttf_d* / ttf_u*) are loaded by a generic
pass after the per-arch loader and applied in build_lora_mm: y = mul_mat(W, c*x + m) + b + U(D(x)). Models without
them are unchanged.
---
